                                "sense_id": "ddf937fb-82d2-3802-8468-bf18019c2c61",
                                "text": "[…]but now it paieth ſeauentie pounds by weight to the King, and an hundred ſhillings for a *Gerſume to the Queene;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a46e692b-5c96-4706-b17b-61c78606d183",
                                "sense_id": "ddf937fb-82d2-3802-8468-bf18019c2c61",
                                "text": "Otherwise, the gersum was in ready money, and the bulk of the rent in uncoined silver."
                            },
